      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like a total failure. my parents moved across the world and worked themselves to the bone just so i could have a chance, and i just blew it. everything they sacrificed for me... it feels like i just wasted it all. i can't even look at them without feeling like a stain on everything they built.",
