      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your words show how deeply you care, but please understand that loved ones often see more strength than you realize behind the surface of your struggle. Your parents have likely withstood their own difficulties by placing their faith in you and helping you build the life you dared to dream of, even if it changed. Rather than isolating yourself, try reaching out to them once you feel slightly stronger; they have been waiting for you to come home safely and not alone.",
