      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please remember that leaving and disappearing does not erase mistakes, but instead only alienates the very people who need to see you facing them. Your parents' hard work was not an investment that could be lost by one setback, but a cycle of love that knows the value of your eventual growth. The shortest path to healing is not to vanish, but to find a therapist or counselor who can help you untangle these deep feelings of guilt and shame.",
